parameters.text:
=You are an expert technical recruiter. Compare the candidate RESUME against the JOB DESCRIPTION and rate how well the candidate matches.

Return your answer as JSON with this exact shape:
{
  "score": <integer 0-100>,
  "verdict": "<Strong Match | Good Match | Partial Match | Weak Match>",
  "matched_skills": ["..."],
  "missing_skills": ["..."],
  "summary": "<2-3 sentence justification>"
}

RESUME:
{{ $("Extract Resume Text").item.json.text }}

JOB DESCRIPTION:
{{ $("Extract JD Text").item.json.text }}

